{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1173660-cybermancy-question","id":1173660,"title":"Cybermancy Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-05T18:45:32-08:00","id":1173660,"title":"Cybermancy Question","content":"I'm confused on how a mage would use the spheres to control a computer or similar electronic device. Would it be Forces to manipulate the flow of electrons in the circuits? If so, how difficult would it be to boot up a computer, run a program, etc? Or is it something like Matter? If so, how?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10653-omegaz","name":"OmegaZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10653_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-05T19:36:01-08:00","id":1173668,"title":"","content":"I am not entirely clear what you are trying to do? use a computer without a monitor and imput device? Power one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-05T19:38:58-08:00","id":1173669,"title":"","content":"There's this thing called the Digital Web which acts as a sort of magical cyberspace. You access it using Correspondence or Data. Personally, I expand this to being able to manipulate software using Correspondence or Data.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-05T19:40:16-08:00","id":1173670,"title":"","content":"Yes, Forces. But you'd be at severe penalties without a decent Technology skill.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T02:44:11-08:00","id":1173720,"title":"","content":"Depends on Paradigm in many respects<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-06T13:04:27-08:00","id":1173820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>OmegaZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1173660-cybermancy-question#post1173660\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm confused on how a mage would use the spheres to control a computer or similar electronic device. Would it be Forces to manipulate the flow of electrons in the circuits? If so, how difficult would it be to boot up a computer, run a program, etc? Or is it something like Matter? If so, how?</div> </div> </div> </div>Typically you can control a computer with Forces 2 or 3, depending on if it needs power or not. Changing the display or output should only be Forces 2. You can set it up to be powered by alternate methods with Forces 3. You should be able to manipulate without an input device via Forces 2 so long as the device is powered. Your ST may call for a Technology roll or just run with it.<br /> <br /> Reading data will take Mind, so you can decipher it. You should be able to read data with Forces 1 and a variable amount of Mind. I believe you need Mind 3 to get a clear picture of what is going on; lower levels of Mind can get vague impressions about data chunks (this is an image file, this is an executable) but not as detailed. Mind should cut through most mundane encryption; a mage could encrypt with Mind 1 and Forces 2. Rewriting data is Forces 2 plus enough Mind to decipher what you are mucking with; you will probably want a Computer roll to change programs this way. Note that you should only need Mind if you aren't using a display device of some kind, like if you just want to telepathically read the hard disk. If it up on a monitor you can just read it normally.<br /> <br /> You will need to be right up on the thing unless you also have Correspondence/Data equal to whatever Sphere effect you wanna use.<br /> <br /> Entropy 3 can fry the whole thing pretty easily, and even irrecoverably with enough successes. Selectively destroying things would require Forces 1 and Mind again, so you know what you are doing. Entropy 3 can also protect your machine as well from normal day-to-day degradation.<br /> <br /> Prime 4 to make a &quot;magic&quot; computer, and Mind 5 to make an AI.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, you can use Spirit to awaken either the spirit of the computer in question to try to get it to obey you or coax a ghost into possessing it and doing the work for you. If you picture your character anthropomorphizing devices a lot - talking to them like they are people, or expecting them to respond to being cussed out - you might take this approach. Remember Spirits are alien and unstable in general.<br /> <br /> Cybermancy can be vulgar, but can sometimes be written off as coincidental due to bugs, glitches, &quot;previously unknown exploits&quot;, malware, or cutting edge technology.<br /> <br /> Everyone who disagrees, please don't hit me.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T10:03:58-08:00","id":1174059,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1173660-cybermancy-question?p=1173820#post1173820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Note that you should only need Mind if you aren't using a display device of some kind, like if you just want to telepathically read the hard disk. If it up on a monitor you can just read it normally.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome, thanks for the great response! Wouldn't the above example be Matter and Mind, since you're reading an object (assuming the disc isn't already in some other machine)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10653-omegaz","name":"OmegaZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10653_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-07T17:08:30-08:00","id":1174156,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>OmegaZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1173660-cybermancy-question?p=1174059#post1174059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Awesome, thanks for the great response! Wouldn't the above example be Matter and Mind, since you're reading an object (assuming the disc isn't already in some other machine)?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would say no, as you are reading the Forces on the disk - the magnetic charges - rather than the object itself. Like if you wanted to know how hot an object was, that seems like it should be Forces 1, not Matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1136-wolfgar","name":"Wolfgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"646"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-08T00:26:07-08:00","id":1174226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wolfgar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1173660-cybermancy-question?p=1174156#post1174156\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would say no, as you are reading the Forces on the disk - the magnetic charges - rather than the object itself. Like if you wanted to know how hot an object was, that seems like it should be Forces 1, not Matter.</div> </div> </div> </div>An argument could be made that it depends on the storage. Flash drives would certainly be forced since data is stored by trapped electrical charges between diodes. But a hard disk which physically changes shape to store information could probably be done with Matter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}